OL,3,AIsraeli army orders criminal
OL,4,Ainvestigation into killing of
OL,5,APalestinian girl Hind Rajab in Gaza
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Israeli army has ordered a criminal
OL,8,Finvestigation into the killing in Gaza
OL,9,Fof five-year-old Hind Rajab, whose
OL,10,Fdeath was internationally condemned
OL,11,Fafter a desperate recording of her
OL,12,Fspeaking to paramedics was broadcast
OL,13,Faround the world.
OL,15,FThe Palestinian child was one of seven
OL,16,Ffamily members travelling in a vehicle
OL,17,Fthat came under Israeli fire in Gaza
OL,18,FCity in January 2024.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
