OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws            G2/2
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AIsraeli army orders criminal
OL,4,Ainvestigation into killing of
OL,5,APalestinian girl Hind Rajab in Gaza
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe initially survived the attack that
OL,8,Fkilled several family members, but her
OL,9,Fbody was recovered days later along
OL,10,Fwith her relatives and two paramedics
OL,11,Fwho had tried to save her in an
OL,12,Fambulance.
OL,14,FIn a statement, the Israel Defense
OL,15,FForces (IDF) said that "following a
OL,16,Freview of the findings" and "due to
OL,17,Falleged failures in the coordination of
OL,18,Fthe movement of the Palestine Red
OL,19,FCrescent ambulance, it has been decided
OL,20,Fto initiate a criminal investigation of
OL,21,Fthe incident by Military Police
OL,22,FCriminal Investigation Division".
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
